      "text": [
        " رِوَايَةِ عَبْدِ اَللَّهِ بْنِ مُسْكَانَ عَنْ أَبِي عَبْدِ اَللَّهِ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ : فِي رَجُلٍ قَطَعَ رَأْسَ اَلْمَيِّتِ قَالَ \"عَلَيْهِ اَلدِّيَةُ لِأَنَّ حُرْمَتَهُ مَيِّتاً كَحُرْمَتِهِ وَ هُوَ حَيٌّ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.5357 - In the narration of Abdullah ibn Muskan from Abu Abdullah Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as), regarding a man who beheaded a dead person\nImam (as) said: \"The blood money is upon him because the sanctity of the deceased is like his sanctity when he was alive.\""
        ]
      }
